{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122060","id":4194984556,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc76CmJs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122060","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122060.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122060.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122060","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122060/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122060/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122060/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2674fab9c6cbb4510999598f0761726603d43b81","number":122060,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix FileDialog input box synchronization with selection","user":{"login":"ELginas","id":42967362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTY3MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42967362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas","html_url":"https://github.com/ELginas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ELginas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Now typing in the FileDialog input box should select/deselect files accordingly. Supports multiple files. Makes FileDialog behave more like KDialog.\r\n\r\nWhen text input box changes, it will select elements. When multiple elements are selected, input text box will only deselect one element if input text box changes. To implement that, `target_id` is used and various `set_text()` calls have been replaced to update `target_id` too.\r\n\r\nWhen FileDialog appears first time, text box is focused synchronously based on default path. However, the elements are not created yet and it causes issues. To fix it, initial focus text is delayed until elements update is finished.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #115106\r\n- Addresses point 1/3 in #36016\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTried to keep PR small, and other changes will be in separate PRs. It still ended up being quite a lot of code for a fix. Tested in different FileDialog modes, many different inputs, on master, and with PRs #121965 and #121971.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abcbe4e7-c6fa-460b-b05b-118511fd0b9b\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15296d64-e00e-4a38-b960-4830f7f598ff\r\n\r\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30664139/MRP.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com